      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find Hiring Contacts (daily, capped 50/run)\nFor companies with an open hiring signal + no contact yet + not suppressed:\nApollo search (domain+title) -> Apollo reveal -> creates the contacts row.\nCap exists to bound Apollo credit spend (2 calls/contact, 4,000/mo budget) -\nponytail: raise the cap or split into more runs/day if the backlog grows\nfaster than 50/day clears it.\nGated on score >= 35 (2026-09-22): get_uncontacted_hiring_companies now computes\na pre-contact company_score (active signal points + employee_band bonus) and\nonly returns companies clearing that bar, best-scored first -- matches spec\nsection 7's stated trigger. Doesn't include title_class/role-email penalty\n(unknowable before a contact exists), so this is a proxy, not the exact\npost-contact score() formula.",
        "color": 6
      }
    },
